WEBVTT

1
00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.246
Whoever gets
to the temple first wins!

2
00:00:57.382 --> 00:00:59.590
What? Aang. no fair!

3
00:01:01.552 --> 00:01:02.661
Let's get him!

4
00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:04.153
Come on. hurry up!

5
00:01:12.201 --> 00:01:13.837
Hi. Nima.
Good morning. Aang.

6
00:01:13.972 --> 00:01:15.372
Hey. Mip-Mip.
Oh. hello. Aang.

7
00:01:22.344 --> 00:01:24.139
Oh. perfect timing.
Huh?

8
00:01:24.709 --> 00:01:26.080
Mind giving me a lift?

9
00:01:26.216 --> 00:01:28.118
Gyatso. this isn't
the best time.

10
00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:29.920
I'm getting old. you know.

11
00:01:30.055 --> 00:01:32.220
My body doesn't move
like it used to.

12
00:01:32.355 --> 00:01:34.426
I'm kind of
in the middle of something.

13
00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:35.884
You are so heavy!

14
00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:39.257
Heavy? Me?
I eat nothing but vegetables.

15
00:01:39.392 --> 00:01:41.192
Pie is not a vegetable.

16
00:01:41.327 --> 00:01:42.797
I'm gonna lose the race!

17
00:01:42.966 --> 00:01:45.062
Race? What race?

18
00:01:45.198 --> 00:01:46.328
We finally won!

19
00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:47.639
We won! We won!

20
00:01:47.808 --> 00:01:49.801
Yay. we did it!

21
00:01:53.647 --> 00:01:56.081
Aang. as an Airbender.

22
00:01:56.216 --> 00:01:59.118
it's important that you know
when to show restraint.

23
00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:02.814
Even if you have
the power to win.

24
00:02:03.216 --> 00:02:04.617
you are the Avatar.

25
00:02:04.786 --> 00:02:08.854
A lot of people
are going to rely on you.

26
00:02:18.631 --> 00:02:20.638
Where's the Avatar?

27
00:02:20.774 --> 00:02:22.440
He's gone! He ran away!

28
00:02:22.576 --> 00:02:24.000
What? I'm here!

29
00:02:24.769 --> 00:02:27.344
Where's the Avatar?
Avatar!

30
00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:30.108
Aang! Where are you?

31
00:02:30.243 --> 00:02:31.810
Gyatso! I'm here!

32
00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:37.247
I'm... I'm... here!

33
00:02:37.383 --> 00:02:39.521
I'm here! I'm here!

34
00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:41.017
Here!

35
00:02:41.627 --> 00:02:42.691
I'm here.

36
00:02:46.961 --> 00:02:48.365
Hey. Momo.

37
00:02:49.162 --> 00:02:50.263
Hi. Appa.

38
00:02:50.365 --> 00:02:52.001
Was I asleep for long?

39
00:02:52.136 --> 00:02:53.895
Okay. okay.
I'm awake already.

40
00:02:53.997 --> 00:02:56.838
I know. I know.
We've got a job to finish.

41
00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:00.135
Let's continue our journey.

42
00:03:00.648 --> 00:03:01.711
Back to our old home.

43
00:03:49.921 --> 00:03:51.526
This may not
have been our best trip.

44
00:03:51.661 --> 00:03:54.761
but any Airbender relic we find
makes it all worthwhile.

45
00:04:00.472 --> 00:04:02.934
This could be the oldest piece
in our collection.

46
00:04:08.746 --> 00:04:10.282
"Sonam."

47
00:04:22.794 --> 00:04:24.021
I miss you.

48
00:04:30.302 --> 00:04:32.496
Momo. go outside with Appa.

49
00:04:34.299 --> 00:04:35.364
Now!

50
00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:40.807
Whoa!

51
00:04:44.447 --> 00:04:46.716
Who are you?
Why are you doing this?

52
00:04:50.652 --> 00:04:53.358
Please stop.
I don't want to hurt you.

53
00:04:56.821 --> 00:04:58.393
Where is it?
Where is it?

54
00:04:58.528 --> 00:04:59.896
No. that's not it.

55
00:05:00.031 --> 00:05:01.333
Hey. those are antiques.

56
00:05:12.909 --> 00:05:14.203
Enough!

57
00:05:17.347 --> 00:05:20.077
Wait! I found it!

58
00:05:21.779 --> 00:05:23.751
Sonam? Why are they after you?

59
00:05:42.609 --> 00:05:43.609
Wait!

60
00:05:46.672 --> 00:05:49.271
No! That's a thousand years old!

61
00:05:53.721 --> 00:05:54.812
Give it to me!

62
00:05:54.947 --> 00:05:56.712
Why don't we just talk?
Maybe I can help.

63
00:05:56.847 --> 00:05:58.922
We don't need your help. Avatar.

64
00:05:59.691 --> 00:06:02.455
We're done living in a world
where Benders have all the power

65
00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:04.520
and we have none.
Who are you?

66
00:06:04.655 --> 00:06:05.729
We're the Denied.

67
00:06:05.864 --> 00:06:06.997
The Denied?

68
00:06:07.132 --> 00:06:08.331
Just kill him already!

69
00:06:08.466 --> 00:06:10.402
No! You'll bring
the whole place down!

70
00:06:37.226 --> 00:06:39.255
You... saved me.

71
00:06:41.268 --> 00:06:43.468
Kallik. grab the map.
Let's go!

72
00:06:57.609 --> 00:06:58.609
Oh. no!

73
00:07:54.967 --> 00:07:57.137
I'm fine.

74
00:07:57.273 --> 00:07:58.643
Momo. I'm fine.

75
00:08:01.611 --> 00:08:03.548
But we've got
to get to Republic City.

76
00:08:04.676 --> 00:08:06.584
Appa. yip-yip!

77
00:08:23.794 --> 00:08:24.827
<i>Water.</i>

78
00:08:25.296 --> 00:08:27.902
<i>Her tribes gather strength
from the moon</i>

79
00:08:28.933 --> 00:08:31.037
<i>and flow with the tides.</i>

80
00:08:32.572 --> 00:08:33.572
<i>Earth.</i>

81
00:08:34.109 --> 00:08:39.651
<i>A kingdom of unshakable will.
reliable and strong.</i>

82
00:08:42.714 --> 00:08:43.745
<i>Fire.</i>

83
00:08:44.314 --> 00:08:47.251
<i>A nation capable
of great destruction.</i>

84
00:08:48.458 --> 00:08:51.695
<i>but also of great warmth.</i>

85
00:08:54.065 --> 00:08:55.190
<i>Air.</i>

86
00:08:55.459 --> 00:08:58.235
<i>Peaceful nomads with
the power of a hurricane.</i>

87
00:08:58.504 --> 00:09:01.034
<i>but the spirit
of a gentle breeze.</i>

88
00:09:03.132 --> 00:09:05.838
<i>For generations. the Avatar.</i>

89
00:09:05.973 --> 00:09:08.706
<i>the one master
of all four elements.</i>

90
00:09:08.874 --> 00:09:11.110
<i>kept the nations in balance.</i>

91
00:09:12.476 --> 00:09:16.150
<i>But when that responsibility
fell to me as a child.</i>

92
00:09:16.286 --> 00:09:17.481
<i>I ran away.</i>

93
00:09:17.883 --> 00:09:19.952
<i>I was caught in a deadly storm.</i>

94
00:09:20.354 --> 00:09:23.558
<i>but my Avatar spirit preserved
me in a sphere of energy</i>

95
00:09:23.694 --> 00:09:27.558
<i>where I stayed
for a hundred years.</i>

96
00:09:27.727 --> 00:09:28.927
<i>I woke to discover</i>

97
00:09:29.062 --> 00:09:31.531
<i>that the balance
preserved by the Avatar</i>

98
00:09:31.666 --> 00:09:34.567
<i>had been destroyed by war.</i>

99
00:09:34.702 --> 00:09:37.070
<i>The Air Nomads were gone.</i>

100
00:09:37.769 --> 00:09:39.403
<i>All but one.</i>

101
00:09:39.538 --> 00:09:40.538
<i>Me.</i>

102
00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.507
<i>I could no longer run
from my responsibility</i>

103
00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:45.045
<i>as the Avatar.</i>

104
00:09:45.814 --> 00:09:48.412
<i>I found allies
from every nation.</i>

105
00:09:48.848 --> 00:09:51.282
<i>Benders and Nonbenders.</i>

106
00:09:52.987 --> 00:09:54.916
<i>Katara taught me
how to waterbend.</i>

107
00:09:55.585 --> 00:09:58.591
<i>Toph trained me in the ways
of the Earthbenders.</i>

108
00:09:59.193 --> 00:10:03.694
<i>Zuko. once my worst enemy.
became my firebending teacher.</i>

109
00:10:04.463 --> 00:10:08.006
<i>Sokka showed me that bravery
is the most important part</i>

110
00:10:08.108 --> 00:10:10.206
<i>of being a leader.</i>

111
00:10:10.341 --> 00:10:12.336
<i>We became a family.</i>

112
00:10:13.239 --> 00:10:16.748
<i>And together. we ended
the Hundred Year War.</i>

113
00:10:17.784 --> 00:10:22.481
<i>Then. we began the hard work
of rebuilding the world.</i>

114
00:10:34.095 --> 00:10:37.098
<i>For so long.
the nation stood apart.</i>

115
00:10:37.233 --> 00:10:38.233
<i>alone.</i>

116
00:10:38.537 --> 00:10:40.030
<i>and we all suffered as a result.</i>

117
00:10:40.132 --> 00:10:43.036
<i>But here. on this ancient site.</i>

118
00:10:43.138 --> 00:10:45.777
<i>we created a place
where all people are welcome.</i>

119
00:10:46.312 --> 00:10:48.404
<i>Bender and Nonbender alike.</i>

120
00:10:48.506 --> 00:10:52.308
<i>working together in peace
to build the future.</i>

121
00:10:52.443 --> 00:10:54.780
<i>Though there are still
those who would seek</i>

122
00:10:54.916 --> 00:10:57.788
to divide us. we remain united.

123
00:10:58.423 --> 00:10:59.883
As a council representative.

124
00:10:59.985 --> 00:11:02.152
I am honored to be here today

125
00:11:02.288 --> 00:11:05.196
celebrating the anniversary
of Republic City

126
00:11:05.365 --> 00:11:07.526
and the opening of Unity Tower.

127
00:11:07.695 --> 00:11:10.031
a symbol for all people.

128
00:11:16.437 --> 00:11:17.533
Look!

129
00:11:17.702 --> 00:11:18.800
Yeah!

130
00:11:18.936 --> 00:11:20.712
It's the Avatar!

131
00:11:23.842 --> 00:11:26.344
Whoo!
Whoo!

132
00:11:32.024 --> 00:11:33.190
Momo!

133
00:11:35.623 --> 00:11:37.185
Appa!

134
00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:39.291
I missed you too. old friend.

135
00:11:41.396 --> 00:11:42.525
Aang!

136
00:11:42.694 --> 00:11:43.694
Katara!

137
00:11:43.729 --> 00:11:44.736
Mm!

138
00:11:48.866 --> 00:11:50.203
You're hurt.

139
00:11:57.812 --> 00:11:59.313
Take a deep breath.

140
00:12:01.584 --> 00:12:03.922
And... exhale.

141
00:12:05.185 --> 00:12:07.183
I've heard the Denied
are growing in numbers.

142
00:12:07.319 --> 00:12:09.390
but they've never
done anything like this.

143
00:12:09.526 --> 00:12:10.751
Attacking the Avatar?

144
00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:12.230
Yeah.

145
00:12:12.365 --> 00:12:14.095
They were incredible fighters.

146
00:12:14.597 --> 00:12:16.395
Even without bending.

147
00:12:18.099 --> 00:12:20.536
Oops. Breathe through it.
Ow!

148
00:12:20.672 --> 00:12:22.602
Be honest.
You're enjoying this.

149
00:12:22.737 --> 00:12:24.705
Aang. this is serious.

150
00:12:24.841 --> 00:12:26.678
Whatever this map they took was.

151
00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:29.413
if they were willing
to kill the Avatar to get it.

152
00:12:29.549 --> 00:12:31.442
what else
are they willing to do?

153
00:12:31.942 --> 00:12:33.843
I don't know.

154
00:12:33.979 --> 00:12:35.512
I'm worried about you.

155
00:12:36.182 --> 00:12:37.683
You're spending more
and more time

156
00:12:37.785 --> 00:12:39.791
at the Air Temple. alone.

157
00:12:41.086 --> 00:12:43.828
It's how I hold on to my past.

158
00:12:45.862 --> 00:12:48.261
I know how hard this is for you.

159
00:12:52.371 --> 00:12:53.971
When I was attacked.

160
00:12:54.607 --> 00:12:57.006
all I could think about
was that...

161
00:12:57.738 --> 00:12:59.272
this could be it.

162
00:13:00.643 --> 00:13:03.276
I'm the last Airbender.

163
00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:08.611
If I die.
my culture dies with me.

164
00:13:11.286 --> 00:13:15.224
You may be the last Airbender.
but you're not alone.

165
00:13:15.926 --> 00:13:19.963
Aang. none of this
would exist without you.

166
00:13:21.162 --> 00:13:23.562
You made the city possible
with your heart

167
00:13:23.665 --> 00:13:25.034
and your mind.

168
00:13:26.602 --> 00:13:27.929
Because of you...

169
00:13:28.431 --> 00:13:30.469
all of the nations live here...

170
00:13:30.605 --> 00:13:31.843
together.

171
00:13:33.807 --> 00:13:35.473
All except mine.

172
00:13:45.488 --> 00:13:46.689
I know...

173
00:13:47.025 --> 00:13:49.828
but the people here
still need your protection.

174
00:13:50.462 --> 00:13:52.891
You're an Airbender...

175
00:13:52.993 --> 00:13:54.998
but you're also the Avatar.

176
00:13:57.203 --> 00:13:58.430
You're right.

177
00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:03.369
Whoever this Sonam person is.
I need to find out more.

178
00:14:29.168 --> 00:14:30.267
Aang.

179
00:14:30.369 --> 00:14:31.535
Avatar Roku.

180
00:14:31.704 --> 00:14:34.029
It is good to see you again.

181
00:14:34.198 --> 00:14:35.539
How can I help you?

182
00:14:35.708 --> 00:14:37.674
In your lifetime.
did you ever hear

183
00:14:37.809 --> 00:14:40.078
of an ancient Airbender
named Sonam?

184
00:14:40.213 --> 00:14:41.403
I have not.

185
00:14:41.539 --> 00:14:44.682
but you have many
past lives to call upon.

186
00:14:44.817 --> 00:14:47.481
Perhaps one further back
in the Avatar cycle

187
00:14:47.617 --> 00:14:49.250
can help you.

188
00:14:49.686 --> 00:14:51.046
Thank you. Avatar Roku.

189
00:14:53.385 --> 00:14:55.155
I'm sorry.
I've never heard of Sonam.

190
00:14:55.291 --> 00:14:56.955
I'm unfamiliar.
Perhaps earlier.

191
00:14:57.057 --> 00:14:58.389
You must go further back.

192
00:14:58.891 --> 00:15:00.640
PAST AVATARS. OVERLAPPING:
You must go further back. Not here.

193
00:15:00.664 --> 00:15:02.395
In the Avatar Cycle.

194
00:15:09.067 --> 00:15:10.942
Um. hello?

195
00:15:11.939 --> 00:15:13.472
Is there anyone here?

196
00:15:14.675 --> 00:15:15.970
Hello?

197
00:15:17.841 --> 00:15:20.714
Who calls upon Avatar Xian's

198
00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:23.152
vast wealth of knowledge?

199
00:15:26.956 --> 00:15:28.122
Oh. hello.

200
00:15:28.424 --> 00:15:31.959
You look like an Avatar from
a time quite distant from mine.

201
00:15:32.094 --> 00:15:34.926
Please. please.
tell me about your era.

202
00:15:35.061 --> 00:15:36.697
What are people wearing?

203
00:15:36.799 --> 00:15:38.399
Are sandals still a thing?

204
00:15:38.534 --> 00:15:39.764
Uh. yes.

205
00:15:39.899 --> 00:15:41.196
Why?

206
00:15:41.298 --> 00:15:43.599
Why. after so many years.

207
00:15:43.734 --> 00:15:47.638
open toes. seeing someone
else's crusty cuticles?

208
00:15:47.939 --> 00:15:49.310
Disgusting!

209
00:15:49.479 --> 00:15:50.479
Right.

210
00:15:50.674 --> 00:15:52.647
Anyway. I have come
for your guidance.

211
00:15:52.782 --> 00:15:54.211
You see. I was attacked.

212
00:15:54.313 --> 00:15:56.319
It was not me. okay?
Wasn't me.

213
00:15:56.454 --> 00:15:57.479
I know that.

214
00:15:57.615 --> 00:15:59.029
I think it might have
something to do

215
00:15:59.053 --> 00:16:00.818
with an Airbender named Sonam.

216
00:16:00.953 --> 00:16:02.821
Hmm. Sonam.

217
00:16:02.957 --> 00:16:04.587
It sounds familiar.

218
00:16:04.722 --> 00:16:07.231
Sonam. Where have I
heard that name before?

219
00:16:07.334 --> 00:16:08.334
Ah-ha!

220
00:16:08.494 --> 00:16:10.210
Sonam was the youngest daughter
of the owner

221
00:16:10.234 --> 00:16:12.427
of the possum-chicken shop
at the corner marketplace.

222
00:16:12.563 --> 00:16:15.300
Wait. that was my ex. So Nyung.

223
00:16:15.469 --> 00:16:18.606
If only she didn't have
those humongous toenails.

224
00:16:18.741 --> 00:16:20.344
Disgusting.

225
00:16:20.513 --> 00:16:21.578
This is going nowhere.

226
00:16:21.713 --> 00:16:23.306
Sonam... So-nahm...
Sonum?

227
00:16:23.442 --> 00:16:25.845
Well. thank you for your time.

228
00:16:26.014 --> 00:16:27.910
I must continue my search.

229
00:16:28.046 --> 00:16:29.920
Oh. Sonam!

230
00:16:30.056 --> 00:16:34.124
You're asking about the legend
of the lost Avatar.

231
00:16:34.493 --> 00:16:36.117
Sonam was an Avatar?

232
00:16:36.253 --> 00:16:37.822
Indeed she was!

233
00:16:37.958 --> 00:16:39.630
She was the Avatar

234
00:16:39.766 --> 00:16:42.459
in the golden age of Airbenders.

235
00:16:42.594 --> 00:16:45.296
Legend said she had
a staff that could channel

236
00:16:45.431 --> 00:16:48.233
the vast energy
of the Spirit World.

237
00:16:48.335 --> 00:16:51.641
granting its keeper
unlimited power.

238
00:16:51.776 --> 00:16:54.078
Is... Is that even possible?

239
00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:57.046
Eh. we'll never know for sure.

240
00:16:57.182 --> 00:16:59.680
Many Avatars have tried
to communicate with her.

241
00:16:59.815 --> 00:17:00.848
but they couldn't.

242
00:17:00.983 --> 00:17:02.544
She disappeared so completely

243
00:17:02.679 --> 00:17:05.556
that it was as if
she never existed.

244
00:17:05.725 --> 00:17:07.853
And perhaps
it's better that way.

245
00:17:08.355 --> 00:17:10.684
Maybe such a staff
was too dangerous

246
00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:14.492
for anyone to possess.
even the Avatar.

247
00:17:14.628 --> 00:17:17.197
But... But that's exactly
why I need to find it.

248
00:17:17.366 --> 00:17:19.998
The people who attacked me
discovered a map.

249
00:17:20.134 --> 00:17:21.831
It must lead to the staff.

250
00:17:22.267 --> 00:17:24.202
Avatar Xian. please.

251
00:17:24.371 --> 00:17:26.572
you have to tell me where it is.

252
00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:32.549
The legend says that Sonam
disappeared with her staff

253
00:17:32.718 --> 00:17:35.119
on the peak of Mount Baihu.

254
00:17:37.552 --> 00:17:40.485
<i>"Katara. I'm sorry
to leave so suddenly.</i>

255
00:17:40.588 --> 00:17:42.721
<i>but I found out
what the Denied are after."</i>

256
00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:45.822
<i>"Sonam had a staff
of immense power."</i>

257
00:17:46.291 --> 00:17:47.424
<i>and in their hands.</i>

258
00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:49.727
<i>"it could be
a devastating weapon."</i>

259
00:17:50.329 --> 00:17:51.800
<i>"They have a head start."</i>

260
00:17:51.902 --> 00:17:53.470
<i>"There's no time to waste."</i>

261
00:17:54.406 --> 00:17:57.499
<i>"You take Appa and Momo and
gather up the rest of the team."</i>

262
00:17:57.601 --> 00:17:59.143
<i>"We're gonna need some help."</i>

263
00:18:05.710 --> 00:18:06.984
Next on the agenda.

264
00:18:07.086 --> 00:18:09.053
a Fire Nation naval vessel
came into conflict

265
00:18:09.188 --> 00:18:12.180
with an extremist group
of Nonbenders called the Denied.

266
00:18:12.283 --> 00:18:15.355
They've been robbing ancient
sites... Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

267
00:18:15.491 --> 00:18:18.120
An urgent message has arrived
from Republic City.

268
00:18:18.256 --> 00:18:19.389
How impudent.

269
00:18:19.525 --> 00:18:21.091
Can't you see
Fire Lord Zuko is...

270
00:18:21.226 --> 00:18:22.430
Chamberlain.

271
00:18:23.299 --> 00:18:25.099
There's only one person
who can send a message

272
00:18:25.138 --> 00:18:27.397
urgent enough to interrupt
the Fire Lord's counsel.

273
00:18:27.766 --> 00:18:29.664
Is it from the Avatar?
Yes. my lord.

274
00:18:29.766 --> 00:18:32.574
Read it to me.
Yes. my lord.

275
00:18:34.746 --> 00:18:36.106
Um...

276
00:18:36.275 --> 00:18:37.381
What are you doing?

277
00:18:37.484 --> 00:18:38.575
Read it quickly.

278
00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:41.077
Uh... Yeah. yeah.
Yes. Grand Chamberlain.

279
00:18:42.451 --> 00:18:45.321
"Flameo Hotman.
how's ruling the Fire Nation?"

280
00:18:45.489 --> 00:18:49.156
"I hope the boring Chamberlain
you mention in your letters

281
00:18:49.292 --> 00:18:51.790
isn't still annoying you."

282
00:18:51.925 --> 00:18:54.965
"Anyhoo. to cut to the chase.
I need your help."

283
00:18:55.134 --> 00:18:57.134
"Can you please
come immediately?"

284
00:18:57.270 --> 00:19:01.129
"Oh. and don't forget to bring
some firecracker buns."

285
00:19:03.504 --> 00:19:06.171
<i>Allow me to present Sokka-Cycle.</i>

286
00:19:06.306 --> 00:19:07.671
Flames launch you into the sky

287
00:19:07.806 --> 00:19:10.344
where you can drop
water bombs on your enemies.

288
00:19:10.513 --> 00:19:13.178
then skis pop out
to help you stick the landing.

289
00:19:13.313 --> 00:19:14.814
Pretty great. right?

290
00:19:14.949 --> 00:19:16.118
Eh. boring.

291
00:19:16.487 --> 00:19:18.560
Why would you need a sled
when you can just waterbend?

292
00:19:18.584 --> 00:19:20.115
Ooh. ooh. ooh.
Like me. like me!

293
00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:21.250
Whee!

294
00:19:21.321 --> 00:19:22.486
Keep in mind. there are still

295
00:19:22.621 --> 00:19:24.424
plenty of folks like me
who can't bend.

296
00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:27.127
Why would Avatar Aang
partner with a Nonbender?

297
00:19:27.263 --> 00:19:29.865
Why?
I'll tell you why.

298
00:19:30.001 --> 00:19:31.428
<i>I saved him from the iceberg.</i>

299
00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:32.896
<i>My boomerang flew by his side</i>

300
00:19:32.998 --> 00:19:35.371
<i>while I parried away enemies
with my trusty blade.</i>

301
00:19:35.539 --> 00:19:38.836
<i>I even took down the whole
Fire Nation airship armada.</i>

302
00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:42.075
<i>And on top of all that.</i>

303
00:19:42.177 --> 00:19:44.072
<i>I was more popular than him.</i>

304
00:19:45.213 --> 00:19:46.680
You're such a liar. Sokka.

305
00:19:49.889 --> 00:19:51.053
It's from the Avatar.

306
00:19:51.188 --> 00:19:52.888
Really? That's so cool! Wow.

307
00:19:53.023 --> 00:19:54.855
Oh. so now you think I'm cool?

308
00:19:56.060 --> 00:19:58.026
<i>All right. Metalbenders.</i>

309
00:19:58.195 --> 00:20:00.260
Let's see if
any of you tenderfoots

310
00:20:00.362 --> 00:20:02.025
can at least make me
use my hands.

311
00:20:35.191 --> 00:20:38.095
I'm still the greatest
Earthbender in the world!

312
00:20:39.606 --> 00:20:40.770
And I'm bored.

313
00:20:41.272 --> 00:20:43.731
Master Toph.
there's a bird on your head.

314
00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:46.268
And?
It looks like it has a message.

315
00:20:46.403 --> 00:20:47.403
Read.

316
00:20:47.708 --> 00:20:50.440
Uh. it's from Avatar Aang.
He needs your help.

317
00:20:50.609 --> 00:20:52.010
It's the Denied?
The Denied?

318
00:20:52.112 --> 00:20:53.176
Where is he?

319
00:20:53.278 --> 00:20:54.776
Mount Baihu.

320
00:21:57.177 --> 00:21:58.844
No. no. no!

321
00:21:59.013 --> 00:22:00.351
No!

322
00:22:03.921 --> 00:22:05.719
I love that hat.

323
00:23:50.124 --> 00:23:51.528
Sonam?

324
00:23:56.264 --> 00:23:57.996
Could that be you?

325
00:25:01.196 --> 00:25:02.393
Who are you?

326
00:25:02.562 --> 00:25:04.392
Huh?

327
00:27:54.632 --> 00:27:55.937
Aang!

328
00:28:23.598 --> 00:28:26.266
Team Avatar to the rescue!

329
00:28:27.601 --> 00:28:28.904
Aang!

330
00:28:29.470 --> 00:28:30.505
You made it!

331
00:28:31.207 --> 00:28:33.412
You couldn't wait a day before
running off to get yourself killed?

332
00:28:33.436 --> 00:28:36.012
I thought you were here
looking for a staff.

333
00:28:36.115 --> 00:28:37.412
Who's this guy?

334
00:28:44.046 --> 00:28:45.789
An Airbender.

335
00:29:06.437 --> 00:29:08.845
How did he hold up
an entire mountain?

336
00:29:08.947 --> 00:29:12.343
His chi is strong.
like nothing I've ever felt.

337
00:29:13.609 --> 00:29:16.176
Hey. Avatar. you think
this guy beat your record

338
00:29:16.278 --> 00:29:18.347
for longest frozen Airbender?

339
00:29:18.449 --> 00:29:21.552
Yeah. How long do you think
he was in that ice?

340
00:29:21.688 --> 00:29:22.850
I don't know.

341
00:29:23.252 --> 00:29:25.720
His tattoos look... ancient.

342
00:29:26.189 --> 00:29:28.089
He's been in there a long time.

343
00:29:28.224 --> 00:29:29.726
He smells good for an old guy.

344
00:29:29.828 --> 00:29:30.828
Ew.
What?

345
00:29:31.066 --> 00:29:32.776
My senses tell me this guy
is pretty attractive.

346
00:29:32.800 --> 00:29:34.000
Toph!
Someone else confirm.

347
00:29:34.169 --> 00:29:36.045
This is serious.
What does attractive even mean?

348
00:29:36.069 --> 00:29:37.635
Just give me
a straight confirmation.

349
00:29:37.770 --> 00:29:38.836
Is he attractive?

350
00:29:39.272 --> 00:29:40.877
He's very attractive.
Huh?

351
00:29:41.674 --> 00:29:43.478
What? He is.

352
00:29:43.613 --> 00:29:44.940
It's all in the bone structure.

353
00:29:45.076 --> 00:29:46.608
No...

354
00:29:47.976 --> 00:29:49.414
No...

355
00:29:49.516 --> 00:29:50.385
No!

356
00:29:50.487 --> 00:29:52.121
Whoa. whoa. whoa. Hey.

357
00:29:52.257 --> 00:29:54.189
Easy. you're safe.

358
00:29:56.486 --> 00:29:58.020
Earthbender!
No. no. no!

359
00:29:58.189 --> 00:30:00.163
We're all friends here.
It's okay.

360
00:30:00.632 --> 00:30:02.131
Someone woke up
on the wrong side

361
00:30:02.267 --> 00:30:03.427
of the mountain.

362
00:30:04.169 --> 00:30:05.235
Where is she?

363
00:30:06.800 --> 00:30:08.599
Where is Avatar Sonam?

364
00:30:08.702 --> 00:30:10.203
You knew Sonam?

365
00:30:11.506 --> 00:30:12.833
Who are you?

366
00:30:13.335 --> 00:30:15.545
I don't know how to explain it.

367
00:30:15.714 --> 00:30:17.881
but you've been asleep
for a long time.

368
00:30:19.175 --> 00:30:20.818
I'm the Avatar now.

369
00:30:21.152 --> 00:30:22.152
I'm Aang.

370
00:30:23.021 --> 00:30:26.384
If you're the Avatar. then...

371
00:30:27.356 --> 00:30:28.551
Sonam...

372
00:30:30.858 --> 00:30:33.830
Well. Sonam might be long gone.

373
00:30:33.965 --> 00:30:36.964
but on the bright side.
you woke up at the perfect time.

374
00:30:37.100 --> 00:30:39.732
Everyone will be amazed
to see another Airbender.

375
00:30:39.867 --> 00:30:42.268
Aang's not the last one anymore.

376
00:30:43.573 --> 00:30:45.932
What do you mean. last?

377
00:30:49.978 --> 00:30:53.708
The Air Nomads.
they've been wiped out.

378
00:30:55.419 --> 00:30:56.711
There's only me.

379
00:30:58.519 --> 00:30:59.747
No.

380
00:31:00.382 --> 00:31:03.157
Sonam's staff. do you have it?

381
00:31:03.725 --> 00:31:05.126
It's our only hope now.

382
00:31:05.858 --> 00:31:07.088
What do you mean?

383
00:31:07.257 --> 00:31:08.866
I thought it was a weapon.

384
00:31:09.929 --> 00:31:11.693
The staff is no weapon.

385
00:31:12.436 --> 00:31:13.794
It is a gift.

386
00:31:16.236 --> 00:31:18.707
<i>With it.
Sonam was able to channel</i>

387
00:31:18.843 --> 00:31:20.904
<i>the vast power
of the Spirit World.</i>

388
00:31:21.574 --> 00:31:25.107
<i>It was this power that
allowed Jharana to flourish.</i>

389
00:31:25.610 --> 00:31:29.918
<i>The greatest city in the world.
an Air Nomad utopia.</i>

390
00:31:30.087 --> 00:31:33.955
<i>where Sonam presided
over a golden age of balance</i>

391
00:31:34.124 --> 00:31:37.555
<i>and where I devoted my life
to serving her.</i>

392
00:31:38.090 --> 00:31:39.961
<i>In return. she raised me up</i>

393
00:31:40.130 --> 00:31:44.258
<i>and used her staff to give me.
a lowly Nonbender.</i>

394
00:31:44.393 --> 00:31:46.662
<i>the power to bend the air.</i>

395
00:31:47.697 --> 00:31:50.765
<i>I was the first.
but I would not be the last.</i>

396
00:31:51.601 --> 00:31:53.801
<i>She filled the skies
with Airbenders.</i>

397
00:31:54.512 --> 00:31:55.942
<i>and we flew by her side.</i>

398
00:31:56.078 --> 00:31:58.311
<i>spreading peace
across the world.</i>

399
00:32:07.118 --> 00:32:10.684
Aang? Are you okay?

400
00:32:10.786 --> 00:32:13.623
Sonam used the staff
to give people airbending.

401
00:32:14.465 --> 00:32:15.856
If we found it...

402
00:32:17.627 --> 00:32:20.327
I could bring airbending
back to the world!

403
00:32:20.496 --> 00:32:21.795
This is incredible!

404
00:32:21.964 --> 00:32:24.635
There haven't been Airbenders
for over a hundred years!

405
00:32:25.371 --> 00:32:28.473
This is everything
you ever wanted. Aang.

406
00:32:29.814 --> 00:32:31.977
We could heal
the greatest atrocity

407
00:32:32.113 --> 00:32:33.975
my nation committed in the war.

408
00:32:34.778 --> 00:32:37.779
This could be the final step
to rebuilding the world.

409
00:32:37.914 --> 00:32:41.486
Not if the Denied get there
first. They have the map.

410
00:32:42.427 --> 00:32:43.625
Who are the Denied?

411
00:32:43.760 --> 00:32:45.920
A group of violent Nonbenders.

412
00:32:46.022 --> 00:32:47.126
They...

413
00:32:47.495 --> 00:32:50.023
They must be after the staff
to give themselves airbending.

414
00:32:50.192 --> 00:32:54.227
Then there's no time to waste.
There's only one place it could be.

415
00:32:54.329 --> 00:32:55.497
Ready your bison.

416
00:32:55.666 --> 00:32:57.799
We'll need to travel
across the endless ocean.

417
00:32:57.934 --> 00:33:01.234
On the other side of the world?
But there's nothing out there.

418
00:33:01.336 --> 00:33:02.842
There's an island.

419
00:33:03.010 --> 00:33:05.007
The journey will not be easy.

420
00:33:05.143 --> 00:33:06.577
But we can make it.

421
00:33:07.552 --> 00:33:09.075
Then let's get going.

422
00:33:10.416 --> 00:33:13.013
The skies are no place
for a water child.

423
00:33:13.149 --> 00:33:14.349
Water child?

424
00:33:14.852 --> 00:33:18.561
Um. I know you just woke up
after thousands of years.

425
00:33:18.730 --> 00:33:20.564
but we do these things together.

426
00:33:20.699 --> 00:33:23.125
Trust me.
We're stronger this way.

427
00:33:23.227 --> 00:33:24.925
Welcome to Team Avatar.

428
00:33:25.470 --> 00:33:26.762
What's your name?

429
00:33:27.470 --> 00:33:28.668
Tagah.

430
00:33:28.803 --> 00:33:30.436
My name is Tagah.

431
00:33:40.083 --> 00:33:43.152
Just think of it
as a big metal air bison.

432
00:33:50.888 --> 00:33:54.229
<i>We will travel
ancient paths through the sky.</i>

433
00:33:55.667 --> 00:33:56.899
<i>Ones that our people learned</i>

434
00:33:57.067 --> 00:33:59.363
<i>by following
the great air bison herds</i>

435
00:33:59.498 --> 00:34:01.566
<i>that long ago
taught us airbending.</i>

436
00:34:02.333 --> 00:34:04.032
<i>Air currents known only to us.</i>

437
00:34:04.801 --> 00:34:08.005
<i>encircling the great sphere
of existence.</i>

438
00:34:08.507 --> 00:34:10.742
<i>allowing us to travel
where we wish.</i>

439
00:34:11.345 --> 00:34:15.448
<i>giving us our name.
the Air Nomads.</i>

440
00:34:44.979 --> 00:34:46.710
What's he doing?

441
00:34:47.246 --> 00:34:48.948
He's really feeling that air.

442
00:34:49.083 --> 00:34:51.821
He's navigating by instinct.

443
00:34:51.957 --> 00:34:54.047
What if his instincts
are just wrong?

444
00:34:54.149 --> 00:34:56.620
Who needs instincts when
you've got muscles like that?

445
00:34:56.756 --> 00:34:59.452
Or what if his brain is
messed up from being frozen?

446
00:34:59.587 --> 00:35:02.426
Like me?
Uh. no. no!

447
00:35:02.562 --> 00:35:05.130
He was frozen for
five thousand years. okay?

448
00:35:05.299 --> 00:35:07.331
You were frozen for.
what. a hundred?

449
00:35:07.500 --> 00:35:09.700
Okay. that's nothing.
Your brain is...

450
00:35:10.639 --> 00:35:11.941
fresh.

451
00:35:12.177 --> 00:35:15.106
Maybe he is a little
old-fashioned. but look at him.

452
00:35:15.308 --> 00:35:16.812
He's so in tune
with his element.

453
00:35:16.948 --> 00:35:19.781
he can travel
across the entire ocean

454
00:35:19.916 --> 00:35:22.218
with no map. no instruments.

455
00:35:23.980 --> 00:35:26.981
There's so much
I can learn from him.

456
00:35:38.501 --> 00:35:41.996
I'd give anything to be able
to see my air bison again.

457
00:35:45.535 --> 00:35:49.212
And now.
to see only one remains.

458
00:35:51.313 --> 00:35:55.449
Aang. you said our people
were wiped out.

459
00:35:55.950 --> 00:35:57.385
yet you survived.

460
00:35:57.883 --> 00:35:59.013
How?

461
00:36:00.718 --> 00:36:03.216
I had just found out
I was the Avatar.

462
00:36:03.852 --> 00:36:07.824
But the responsibility.
it was too much.

463
00:36:09.568 --> 00:36:11.025
So I ran away.

464
00:36:12.026 --> 00:36:15.700
And while I was gone.
the Fire Nation attacked.

465
00:36:18.006 --> 00:36:19.605
They were looking for me.

466
00:36:21.413 --> 00:36:22.608
If...

467
00:36:23.407 --> 00:36:24.974
If I'd just been there.

468
00:36:25.409 --> 00:36:26.850
Sonam would say.

469
00:36:26.985 --> 00:36:29.717
Air Nomads are formed
from the mist.

470
00:36:30.286 --> 00:36:32.752
We walk the world
for a moment in time.

471
00:36:33.255 --> 00:36:36.721
then we return
to the eternal wind.

472
00:36:38.060 --> 00:36:39.922
Monk Gyatso taught me that.

473
00:36:40.832 --> 00:36:42.593
We carry the same weight.

474
00:36:42.728 --> 00:36:45.692
a grief no one else
could possibly comprehend.

475
00:36:45.828 --> 00:36:48.738
But you and I can heal the past.

476
00:36:49.240 --> 00:36:52.742
Let me show you how powerful
our element can be

477
00:36:52.877 --> 00:36:55.036
when Airbenders work together.

478
00:36:58.179 --> 00:36:59.976
Tagah. what are you doing?

479
00:37:00.078 --> 00:37:01.245
Whoa!

480
00:37:01.380 --> 00:37:03.214
This is how Sonam taught me.

481
00:37:03.349 --> 00:37:05.783
Feel the energy that tethers us.

482
00:37:11.559 --> 00:37:14.430
The bond between us.
Can you feel it?

483
00:37:14.565 --> 00:37:15.565
Use it!

484
00:37:15.700 --> 00:37:17.157
This is amazing!

485
00:37:18.164 --> 00:37:19.830
Yeah!

486
00:37:22.397 --> 00:37:23.805
Woo-hoo!

487
00:37:23.974 --> 00:37:26.268
Oh. yeah!
Human boomerang!

488
00:37:26.404 --> 00:37:27.576
He's actually flying.

489
00:37:27.712 --> 00:37:28.770
So are we.

490
00:37:28.939 --> 00:37:31.446
Whoa. that's my best friend!
That's my best friend!

491
00:37:32.607 --> 00:37:34.108
Now you throw me!

492
00:38:02.575 --> 00:38:04.704
I had no idea this was possible!

493
00:38:04.806 --> 00:38:06.844
This is only the beginning.

494
00:38:14.188 --> 00:38:15.789
I can't believe it.

495
00:38:16.292 --> 00:38:18.289
Airbenders will fill
the sky again.

496
00:38:18.691 --> 00:38:20.893
We have been given a great gift.

497
00:38:21.328 --> 00:38:23.193
The chance to redeem ourselves.

498
00:38:23.929 --> 00:38:26.930
You were destined to find me
on that mountain. Aang.

499
00:38:28.764 --> 00:38:30.736
How did you end up there?

500
00:38:34.377 --> 00:38:36.645
The Earthbenders
had attacked Jharana.

501
00:38:37.248 --> 00:38:39.945
Sonam and I fought fearlessly.
side by side.

502
00:38:40.481 --> 00:38:42.677
We drove them
back to Mount Baihu.

503
00:38:42.813 --> 00:38:45.014
and that's the last I remember.

504
00:38:46.683 --> 00:38:48.353
She must have saved your life.

505
00:38:48.789 --> 00:38:51.592
Only an Avatar could have
put you in that sphere.

506
00:38:55.197 --> 00:38:58.292
Aang. can I ask you something?

507
00:38:58.428 --> 00:38:59.428
Of course.

508
00:38:59.799 --> 00:39:02.703
If the Fire Nation
destroyed the Air Nomads...

509
00:39:03.506 --> 00:39:06.466
how can you suffer
the presence of the Fire Lord?

510
00:39:09.442 --> 00:39:11.311
Zuko is a friend and an ally.

511
00:39:11.814 --> 00:39:14.776
He turned against his own
father to help me end the war.

512
00:39:14.878 --> 00:39:17.816
Yet he wears
the crown himself now.

513
00:39:18.814 --> 00:39:21.418
Fire by its nature burns. Aang.

514
00:39:22.221 --> 00:39:26.088
Our kind have always suffered
at the hands of the other elements.

515
00:39:27.428 --> 00:39:29.261
That's why
we built Republic City.

516
00:39:29.764 --> 00:39:32.232
To show the world that
if we listen to each other.

517
00:39:32.368 --> 00:39:34.529
we can all live
together in peace.

518
00:39:36.240 --> 00:39:38.474
And once
we bring back Airbenders.

519
00:39:39.206 --> 00:39:40.641
it'll be complete.

520
00:39:43.742 --> 00:39:45.840
When everyone stuck
to their own.

521
00:39:45.976 --> 00:39:48.418
the whole world
was nearly torn apart.

522
00:39:49.187 --> 00:39:53.581
And besides. Katara.
Sokka. Zuko. Toph...

523
00:39:53.716 --> 00:39:55.315
they're my family now.

524
00:39:56.418 --> 00:39:59.594
I want to live in a world
where we can all be together.

525
00:40:00.922 --> 00:40:03.466
You remind me so much of Sonam.

526
00:40:08.071 --> 00:40:09.303
It's the Avatar.

527
00:40:09.472 --> 00:40:11.831
And this time he's got
his friends with him.

528
00:40:11.933 --> 00:40:13.476
That's the Fire Lord's airship!

529
00:40:13.644 --> 00:40:16.110
How'd they get ahead of us?
They don't even have the map!

530
00:40:16.612 --> 00:40:18.614
We can't risk him
getting to the staff first.

531
00:40:18.783 --> 00:40:19.783
Kill him.

532
00:40:19.808 --> 00:40:21.113
But he spared our lives.

533
00:40:21.882 --> 00:40:24.150
And how many countless were
killed in the hundred years

534
00:40:24.318 --> 00:40:25.419
waiting for his return?

535
00:40:25.621 --> 00:40:28.122
Where was he when
your family was wiped out?

536
00:40:28.257 --> 00:40:29.653
If we want anything to change.

537
00:40:29.822 --> 00:40:32.786
we need what
the Benders have... Power.

538
00:40:41.167 --> 00:40:42.362
Fire!

539
00:40:47.945 --> 00:40:49.479
It's the Denied!

540
00:40:51.975 --> 00:40:54.209
Uh. we are definitely
under attack!

541
00:40:55.811 --> 00:40:57.377
Tear them to shreds!

542
00:41:10.298 --> 00:41:12.161
Is he crushing the ship?

543
00:41:14.266 --> 00:41:15.329
Tagah?

544
00:41:16.170 --> 00:41:17.332
Tagah. stop!

545
00:41:42.625 --> 00:41:43.896
We're here.

546
00:41:45.828 --> 00:41:47.735
The Immortal Storm.

547
00:41:48.234 --> 00:41:49.234
Oh. no.

548
00:41:54.544 --> 00:41:57.171
There has to be
another way around. No!

549
00:41:57.307 --> 00:41:59.739
Together. you and I
can clear a path for the ship.

550
00:41:59.908 --> 00:42:01.276
But we have to go now.

551
00:42:02.151 --> 00:42:04.347
Aang. trust me.

552
00:42:07.557 --> 00:42:09.556
Uh. maybe now's
a good time to turn back.

553
00:42:09.725 --> 00:42:12.258
I don't think
that's an option anymore.

554
00:42:12.393 --> 00:42:13.728
Where are they going?

555
00:42:22.264 --> 00:42:24.673
The engine's out.
We're losing air pressure.

556
00:42:26.537 --> 00:42:27.775
Whoa!

557
00:42:30.206 --> 00:42:32.672
Katara. Toph. come with me.
What about me?

558
00:42:32.808 --> 00:42:33.877
Take the wheel.

559
00:42:34.246 --> 00:42:36.817
What? No. I've only ever
crashed Fire Nation airships.

560
00:42:38.213 --> 00:42:39.751
Okay. let's see.
Here's our rudder.

561
00:42:39.886 --> 00:42:41.460
this is the elevator.
there's our ballast.

562
00:42:41.484 --> 00:42:44.121
and there's the giant tornado
that's going to kill us all.

563
00:42:47.691 --> 00:42:49.159
Follow my lead.

564
00:43:00.202 --> 00:43:02.744
Work with me.
just like I showed you.

565
00:43:03.477 --> 00:43:05.208
We can harness the air.

566
00:43:15.486 --> 00:43:17.693
Yes! That's it. Aang!
Keep going!

567
00:43:27.772 --> 00:43:29.970
There's a long tear
above your head on the left.

568
00:43:30.105 --> 00:43:31.132
Got it!

569
00:43:31.468 --> 00:43:34.141
Whatever happens. you
have to hold the ship together.

570
00:43:34.310 --> 00:43:35.939
<i>Zuko! Zuko!</i>

571
00:43:36.074 --> 00:43:38.040
Aang and Tagah
are destroying tornadoes.

572
00:43:38.142 --> 00:43:40.778
but there's too many.
and they're everywhere!

573
00:43:40.913 --> 00:43:42.985
Just steer the ship.
Don't lose Aang.

574
00:43:43.154 --> 00:43:44.287
It's not that easy.

575
00:43:44.422 --> 00:43:46.679
especially when
everything is sideways.

576
00:43:46.848 --> 00:43:48.483
Okay. left!

577
00:43:56.694 --> 00:43:58.758
I did it!

578
00:43:58.894 --> 00:44:00.868
Right!

579
00:44:08.874 --> 00:44:11.043
Oh. no!
We're falling behind!

580
00:44:12.012 --> 00:44:14.710
I'm losing sight of them!
We have to go back!

581
00:44:14.845 --> 00:44:16.012
Trust in your friends.

582
00:44:16.148 --> 00:44:18.754
They won't make it
if we don't clear a path.

583
00:44:31.734 --> 00:44:33.869
Zuko! We're gonna
crash into the sea!

584
00:44:34.037 --> 00:44:37.531
When I give you the signal.
pull the lever next to the wheel.

585
00:44:41.844 --> 00:44:43.746
We're gonna crash!
We're gonna crash!

586
00:44:44.014 --> 00:44:45.143
Katara?

587
00:45:04.767 --> 00:45:06.593
Give me the signal!
Give me the signal!

588
00:45:11.273 --> 00:45:12.500
It's closed!

589
00:45:13.935 --> 00:45:15.340
Sokka. now!

590
00:45:15.442 --> 00:45:16.736
Here we go!

591
00:45:39.468 --> 00:45:41.661
Katara! We did it!

592
00:45:42.570 --> 00:45:44.100
What were you thinking?

593
00:45:44.236 --> 00:45:45.676
I was clearing the tornadoes
to make a path.

594
00:45:45.700 --> 00:45:47.801
The ship almost crashed. Aang.
We could have died.

595
00:45:47.970 --> 00:45:50.276
And what if you
got yourself killed?

596
00:45:50.445 --> 00:45:51.445
You're the Avatar.

597
00:45:51.572 --> 00:45:54.249
This is too risky.
We need to turn back now.

598
00:45:54.384 --> 00:45:56.618
No! We're almost there.

599
00:45:56.753 --> 00:45:59.614
We just need to get
to the eye of the storm.

600
00:46:00.217 --> 00:46:02.658
Aang. no.
This is too dangerous.

601
00:46:02.827 --> 00:46:05.422
The staff is out there.
The Denied are after it.

602
00:46:05.557 --> 00:46:08.196
Do you really believe that they
could make it through the storm?

603
00:46:08.298 --> 00:46:09.388
We're nearly there.

604
00:46:09.523 --> 00:46:11.457
That staff
can bring back my people.

605
00:46:11.592 --> 00:46:13.009
I understand how much
you want that. but...

606
00:46:13.033 --> 00:46:15.332
You don't understand.
None of you do.

607
00:46:16.568 --> 00:46:17.972
Aang...

608
00:46:19.870 --> 00:46:20.870
We push forward.

609
00:46:24.609 --> 00:46:27.850
If we generate enough air.
we can push our way through.

610
00:47:11.758 --> 00:47:13.854
We're alive?

611
00:47:14.457 --> 00:47:17.028
We made it through.
Thank you. Tagah.

612
00:47:17.164 --> 00:47:19.864
It was you. Aang.
We're here because of you.

613
00:47:20.033 --> 00:47:21.663
Yeah. we're having
a good time. too.

614
00:47:21.865 --> 00:47:24.305
You could have told us we were
flying into the Immortal Storm.

615
00:47:24.368 --> 00:47:26.966
I know it was dangerous.
but we had to risk it.

616
00:47:27.102 --> 00:47:28.171
We?

617
00:47:28.306 --> 00:47:30.305
I don't remember when
we took a vote on that.

618
00:47:30.440 --> 00:47:32.581
There wasn't time.
I had to make a call.

619
00:47:32.717 --> 00:47:34.540
Friends. please.
don't blame Aang.

620
00:47:34.676 --> 00:47:36.275
This is all my fault.

621
00:47:36.377 --> 00:47:38.120
I knew this would be difficult.

622
00:47:38.889 --> 00:47:41.524
But Aang believed
in your strength as a team.

623
00:47:41.659 --> 00:47:43.783
And I'm honored
to be a part of it.

624
00:47:49.763 --> 00:47:51.395
I forgive you. Tagah.

625
00:47:51.831 --> 00:47:53.595
Everyone. look.

626
00:47:54.870 --> 00:47:59.139
These islands.
they were Lion Turtles.

627
00:48:01.002 --> 00:48:02.109
Whoa.

628
00:48:03.447 --> 00:48:04.938
It's beautiful.

629
00:48:07.241 --> 00:48:08.945
Long before my time.

630
00:48:09.081 --> 00:48:10.847
the Lion Turtles
granted the gift

631
00:48:10.982 --> 00:48:12.583
of bending to humans.

632
00:48:13.153 --> 00:48:16.021
These are their final
resting grounds.

633
00:48:16.123 --> 00:48:19.457
This is where Sonam came
to learn their ways.

634
00:48:20.127 --> 00:48:23.597
I am certain that
she left her staff here.

635
00:48:23.765 --> 00:48:25.259
Where should we start looking?

636
00:48:25.428 --> 00:48:28.268
Aang. you must connect with her.

637
00:48:28.937 --> 00:48:31.839
But no one
can connect with Sonam.

638
00:48:31.941 --> 00:48:33.936
The spiritual power
of the Lion Turtles

639
00:48:34.105 --> 00:48:35.838
is still concentrated here.

640
00:48:35.940 --> 00:48:37.508
Let it guide you.

641
00:48:37.944 --> 00:48:39.343
We'll set out immediately.

642
00:48:39.512 --> 00:48:42.378
Actually. Tagah. we could
really use your help here.

643
00:48:42.481 --> 00:48:45.580
If the Denied are close behind.
we need to be ready.

644
00:48:45.716 --> 00:48:48.422
Yeah. and we're gonna need more
than Toph's metal bending

645
00:48:48.557 --> 00:48:49.591
to fix this ship.

646
00:48:49.794 --> 00:48:51.622
My bending got us
through that storm.

647
00:48:51.758 --> 00:48:52.789
What did you do?

648
00:48:52.958 --> 00:48:54.087
Steered with his feet.

649
00:48:54.222 --> 00:48:55.560
Repairs can wait.

650
00:48:55.663 --> 00:48:56.863
Aang needs me.

651
00:48:57.032 --> 00:49:00.794
Tagah. please.
stay and help my friends.

652
00:49:01.296 --> 00:49:03.005
I'll be okay on my own.

653
00:49:03.604 --> 00:49:04.704
As you wish.

654
00:49:05.073 --> 00:49:07.977
We will begin repairs
for our voyage home.

655
00:49:09.808 --> 00:49:13.572
Everyone. I know I've asked
a lot of you on this journey.

656
00:49:13.707 --> 00:49:15.946
but we're about
to accomplish something

657
00:49:16.081 --> 00:49:17.987
that will change the world.

658
00:50:09.330 --> 00:50:11.073
Let it guide you.

659
00:50:27.258 --> 00:50:28.717
Sonam?

660
00:50:46.639 --> 00:50:50.406
Oh. this is turning out to be
a nice little vacation.

661
00:50:50.575 --> 00:50:52.975
Aside from all the people
trying to kill us.

662
00:50:53.077 --> 00:50:54.077
And the tornadoes.

663
00:50:54.314 --> 00:50:56.542
Um. we're supposed
to be fixing the ship?

664
00:50:56.678 --> 00:50:58.381
You're doing great. buddy.

665
00:50:58.516 --> 00:51:00.688
Has anyone seen Tagah?

666
00:51:00.790 --> 00:51:02.416
Yes. we've all seen Tagah.

667
00:51:02.585 --> 00:51:05.127
He's so gorgeous.
Jeez. I get it.

668
00:51:05.761 --> 00:51:06.957
Oh. I see what you mean.

669
00:51:07.125 --> 00:51:08.759
He wandered off that way.

670
00:51:08.928 --> 00:51:11.199
No. maybe that way?

671
00:51:44.963 --> 00:51:46.201
Tagah!

672
00:51:46.669 --> 00:51:48.527
Where are you going?

673
00:51:48.629 --> 00:51:50.370
Aang needs to be protected.

674
00:51:50.935 --> 00:51:52.141
I agree.

675
00:51:54.637 --> 00:51:57.471
I know my ways
may seem unusual to you.

676
00:51:57.607 --> 00:52:00.580
but I assure you.
everything I do.

677
00:52:00.683 --> 00:52:01.914
I do for Aang.

678
00:52:02.050 --> 00:52:04.813
For Aang?
Or for the staff?

679
00:52:05.989 --> 00:52:08.681
You have no idea
all that we've lost.

680
00:52:08.817 --> 00:52:11.259
You've never known
a world with Airbenders.

681
00:52:11.924 --> 00:52:13.492
I know Aang.

682
00:52:14.127 --> 00:52:15.997
<i>He may be the last of his kind.</i>

683
00:52:16.166 --> 00:52:18.664
<i>but he's the reason
this world knows peace.</i>

684
00:52:22.373 --> 00:52:26.307
<i>His values as an Air Nomad
have brought balance to chaos.</i>

685
00:52:28.607 --> 00:52:31.806
<i>It's because of Aang
that the Water Tribes.</i>

686
00:52:31.941 --> 00:52:35.474
<i>Earth Kingdom. and Fire Nation
now work together.</i>

687
00:52:35.609 --> 00:52:37.513
<i>striving for harmony.</i>

688
00:52:37.681 --> 00:52:40.288
<i>a peace we once
thought unattainable.</i>

689
00:52:42.826 --> 00:52:44.355
<i>You speak of peace.</i>

690
00:52:44.524 --> 00:52:47.528
There will never be peace
among the elements.

691
00:52:47.697 --> 00:52:48.821
<i>There never was.</i>

692
00:52:49.123 --> 00:52:52.064
<i>Your precious Republic City
is built on lies.</i>

693
00:52:52.199 --> 00:52:54.361
<i>It's built on hope.</i>

694
00:52:54.530 --> 00:52:55.895
<i>Do you have hope. Tagah?</i>

695
00:52:56.030 --> 00:52:59.068
Saving my people requires
more than just hope.

696
00:52:59.237 --> 00:53:00.909
It requires sacrifice.

697
00:53:01.078 --> 00:53:04.042
I saw you try to crush
the Denied's airships.

698
00:53:04.177 --> 00:53:05.874
You were ready to kill them.

699
00:53:08.085 --> 00:53:10.879
<i>I know what kind
of Airbender Aang is...</i>

700
00:53:13.353 --> 00:53:15.587
but what kind
of Airbender are you?

701
00:53:44.186 --> 00:53:46.019
Aang did well getting us here.

702
00:53:46.455 --> 00:53:50.216
There is great strength in him.
but weakness as well.

703
00:53:50.351 --> 00:53:51.493
Weakness?

704
00:53:51.595 --> 00:53:52.856
Yes.

705
00:53:52.958 --> 00:53:54.023
You.

706
00:54:10.571 --> 00:54:11.710
What the hog monkey?

707
00:54:15.651 --> 00:54:16.681
No!

708
00:54:35.398 --> 00:54:37.064
He trusted you!

709
00:54:44.009 --> 00:54:45.171
No.

710
00:54:48.812 --> 00:54:50.352
You traitor!

711
00:55:38.228 --> 00:55:39.566
Tagah!

712
00:56:05.455 --> 00:56:06.593
Brother.

713
00:56:09.492 --> 00:56:11.829
Tagah. It's real.

714
00:56:16.173 --> 00:56:18.638
We can finally
bring back airbending.

715
00:56:21.770 --> 00:56:23.040
Let's go tell the others.

716
00:56:23.176 --> 00:56:24.446
We can do this.

717
00:56:25.111 --> 00:56:26.438
Me and you.

718
00:56:27.074 --> 00:56:29.143
I can't do this
without my friends.

719
00:56:31.255 --> 00:56:34.313
Earth killed my people.
Fire killed yours.

720
00:56:34.415 --> 00:56:38.454
The staff is the only way
we can create a new Air Empire.

721
00:56:38.589 --> 00:56:40.924
One capable of defending itself.

722
00:56:41.060 --> 00:56:42.096
No.

723
00:56:42.232 --> 00:56:44.229
We can build
a new future. Tagah.

724
00:56:44.364 --> 00:56:46.299
But it has to be for everyone.

725
00:56:46.468 --> 00:56:48.594
The staff doesn't
belong to everyone.

726
00:56:48.729 --> 00:56:49.861
It belongs to us.

727
00:56:49.997 --> 00:56:51.807
What...
What have you done?

728
00:56:51.976 --> 00:56:55.705
As long as they were around. you'd
always put them ahead of our people.

729
00:56:55.807 --> 00:56:59.340
Don't you see?
This is how we redeem ourselves.

730
00:56:59.942 --> 00:57:01.709
It doesn't matter
that you ran then.

731
00:57:01.811 --> 00:57:03.812
As long as you stand
with me now.

732
00:57:03.980 --> 00:57:06.822
No... Katara.
Aang. listen to me.

733
00:57:06.957 --> 00:57:08.318
This is the only way.

734
00:57:22.138 --> 00:57:24.068
You're a traitor to your own.

735
00:57:24.171 --> 00:57:26.332
Just like Sonam.

736
00:58:04.007 --> 00:58:06.581
I wanted to do this
with you by my side.

737
00:58:07.516 --> 00:58:10.211
But if I must build
the new Air Empire alone...

738
00:58:11.283 --> 00:58:12.587
so be it.

739
00:58:20.620 --> 00:58:23.857
There's no way in!
We have to turn back!

740
00:58:23.993 --> 00:58:27.030
No! We keep trying
to push through!

741
00:58:39.411 --> 00:58:41.110
Sonam's staff.

742
00:58:41.985 --> 00:58:43.379
Denied...

743
00:58:43.515 --> 00:58:45.177
the Avatar is dead.

744
00:58:45.546 --> 00:58:48.418
If you wish to build a new world
where you have the power.

745
00:58:48.553 --> 00:58:50.317
I can give it to you.

746
00:59:05.567 --> 00:59:06.740
Appa!

747
00:59:06.909 --> 00:59:08.535
Katara!

748
00:59:08.671 --> 00:59:10.106
Katara!

749
00:59:11.408 --> 00:59:12.647
Katara.

750
00:59:13.280 --> 00:59:14.649
They're gone.

751
00:59:15.216 --> 00:59:16.750
It's all my fault.

752
00:59:17.583 --> 00:59:19.280
It's always been my fault.

753
00:59:19.782 --> 00:59:21.755
Ever since I ran away.

754
00:59:23.319 --> 00:59:26.788
No Avatar has ever
fallen into such shame

755
00:59:26.957 --> 00:59:29.191
as to join me here in my sorrow.

756
00:59:31.201 --> 00:59:33.129
Why do you grieve so. friend?

757
00:59:33.629 --> 00:59:35.670
Avatar Sonam?

758
00:59:38.274 --> 00:59:40.136
Tagah murdered my friends.

759
00:59:40.704 --> 00:59:42.370
And now he has the staff.

760
00:59:42.506 --> 00:59:44.243
Tagah? No.

761
00:59:44.378 --> 00:59:47.212
No. I... I stopped him.

762
00:59:47.314 --> 00:59:48.782
I hid the staff.

763
00:59:49.218 --> 00:59:51.378
What have you done?

764
00:59:52.081 --> 00:59:54.285
You're the one
who gave him airbending!

765
00:59:54.721 --> 00:59:57.015
How could you give power
to a monster?

766
00:59:57.551 --> 01:00:01.292
The Tagah I gave bending to
was a different man.

767
01:00:02.860 --> 01:00:04.628
<i>It was a different time.</i>

768
01:00:05.364 --> 01:00:08.234
<i>The Airbenders were the
peacekeepers of the four elements.</i>

769
01:00:08.736 --> 01:00:11.302
<i>We used our power
to mediate all conflict</i>

770
01:00:11.471 --> 01:00:12.699
<i>with non-violence.</i>

771
01:00:13.202 --> 01:00:15.238
<i>But we were
the fewest in numbers.</i>

772
01:00:16.141 --> 01:00:19.740
<i>For many years. we existed
in a beautiful balance</i>

773
01:00:19.842 --> 01:00:21.414
<i>of great prosperity.</i>

774
01:00:21.516 --> 01:00:23.412
<i>But the world began to shift.</i>

775
01:00:24.115 --> 01:00:26.411
<i>The Earthbenders
formed their own kingdom.</i>

776
01:00:26.547 --> 01:00:29.153
<i>separating from
the other elemental tribes.</i>

777
01:00:29.822 --> 01:00:31.958
<i>The balance of the world
was at risk.</i>

778
01:00:32.360 --> 01:00:34.520
<i>It was my duty to act.</i>

779
01:00:35.532 --> 01:00:37.159
<i>So I learned how
to channel the energy</i>

780
01:00:37.328 --> 01:00:39.893
<i>of the Spirit World
just as the Lion Turtles did.</i>

781
01:00:40.229 --> 01:00:43.331
<i>To give people
the power of airbending.</i>

782
01:00:44.240 --> 01:00:45.868
<i>My most devout pupil.</i>

783
01:00:46.004 --> 01:00:48.743
<i>Tagah. was the first
to receive it.</i>

784
01:00:49.709 --> 01:00:51.577
<i>I sent my new peacekeepers out</i>

785
01:00:51.679 --> 01:00:53.805
<i>to help calm the growing unrest.</i>

786
01:00:54.608 --> 01:00:57.209
<i>But they were not prepared
for the brutality</i>

787
01:00:57.378 --> 01:00:59.545
<i>of the new Earth Kingdom.</i>

788
01:01:01.454 --> 01:01:02.720
<i>Tagah watched</i>

789
01:01:03.123 --> 01:01:06.585
<i>as his brothers and sisters
were all slaughtered.</i>

790
01:01:07.454 --> 01:01:10.190
<i>His heart darkened
by the violence of war.</i>

791
01:01:10.659 --> 01:01:14.967
<i>He now saw everyone who
wasn't an Air Nomad as the enemy.</i>

792
01:01:16.300 --> 01:01:18.572
<i>Tagah begged me to use
the staff to create an army</i>

793
01:01:18.740 --> 01:01:21.402
<i>and to kill
all who would do us harm.</i>

794
01:01:21.869 --> 01:01:23.338
<i>I refused.</i>

795
01:01:23.707 --> 01:01:24.837
<i>So he stole it.</i>

796
01:01:26.542 --> 01:01:28.209
<i>When he connected the staff
to the temple.</i>

797
01:01:28.345 --> 01:01:31.346
<i>his energy was so corrupted
by grief and rage</i>

798
01:01:31.482 --> 01:01:33.383
<i>that the power
of the Spirit World</i>

799
01:01:33.519 --> 01:01:34.548
<i>consumed him.</i>

800
01:01:35.317 --> 01:01:38.522
<i>Tagah became something
more than human.</i>

801
01:01:38.657 --> 01:01:40.157
<i>too powerful to kill.</i>

802
01:01:41.225 --> 01:01:43.798
<i>It took all my energy
to finally trap him</i>

803
01:01:43.900 --> 01:01:47.736
<i>high above the clouds.
where no one would find him.</i>

804
01:01:48.634 --> 01:01:50.531
<i>I reclaimed the staff.</i>

805
01:01:51.000 --> 01:01:52.635
<i>but I was fatally wounded.</i>

806
01:01:53.237 --> 01:01:55.775
<i>Before the Earth Kingdom
could invade Jharana.</i>

807
01:01:55.911 --> 01:01:58.813
<i>I sent the remaining Air Nomads
into the mountains.</i>

808
01:01:59.682 --> 01:02:01.812
<i>And I hid my temple
in the Spirit World.</i>

809
01:02:01.914 --> 01:02:04.412
<i>where no one
could access its power.</i>

810
01:02:06.016 --> 01:02:08.280
<i>Then I locked the staff away.</i>

811
01:02:08.449 --> 01:02:10.990
<i>where only the Avatar
could find it.</i>

812
01:02:12.252 --> 01:02:14.992
<i>I died. hoping that one day.</i>

813
01:02:15.094 --> 01:02:17.630
<i>another Avatar would
create more Airbenders</i>

814
01:02:17.766 --> 01:02:20.131
<i>and restore balance
to this world.</i>

815
01:02:20.865 --> 01:02:23.468
And that Avatar is you. Aang.

816
01:02:23.603 --> 01:02:25.065
You have to get my staff

817
01:02:25.201 --> 01:02:27.105
before Tagah connects it
to the temple.

818
01:02:27.606 --> 01:02:29.004
There's still time.

819
01:02:29.106 --> 01:02:31.212
Don't let my regret
become yours.

820
01:02:31.881 --> 01:02:34.347
My friends and I
fought hard for this peace.

821
01:02:34.749 --> 01:02:37.218
I won't let him
start another war.

822
01:02:37.353 --> 01:02:38.947
Help me find a way back.

823
01:02:40.717 --> 01:02:41.823
Sonam?

824
01:02:43.083 --> 01:02:44.320
What's happening?

825
01:02:46.491 --> 01:02:47.491
No!

826
01:02:47.625 --> 01:02:49.229
No! Please!

827
01:02:49.365 --> 01:02:50.531
I have to fix this!

828
01:02:50.633 --> 01:02:53.001
This can't be it!
I can't die yet!

829
01:02:53.137 --> 01:02:54.598
Please! Not yet!

830
01:02:54.733 --> 01:02:56.129
No!
<i>Aang?</i>

831
01:02:56.265 --> 01:02:57.966
Katara?
<i>I'm losing him.</i>

832
01:02:58.102 --> 01:03:00.571
<i>Come on. Aang!
Come on! Aang!</i>

833
01:03:00.673 --> 01:03:02.273
Hold on!

834
01:03:02.408 --> 01:03:03.735
Aang!

835
01:03:04.938 --> 01:03:05.938
Katara!

836
01:03:06.073 --> 01:03:07.409
I was so worried.

837
01:03:07.810 --> 01:03:08.810
Aang!

838
01:03:08.880 --> 01:03:10.846
Sokka!

839
01:03:10.982 --> 01:03:12.383
I knew you'd
pull through. buddy.

840
01:03:12.485 --> 01:03:13.485
Hey. Aang.

841
01:03:13.518 --> 01:03:14.750
Zuko!

842
01:03:14.852 --> 01:03:16.122
Momo!

843
01:03:16.624 --> 01:03:18.324
Welcome back. twinkle toes.

844
01:03:18.459 --> 01:03:20.257
Toph. you're okay.

845
01:03:20.393 --> 01:03:21.626
I...

846
01:03:21.761 --> 01:03:22.990
I thought you were all dead.

847
01:03:23.125 --> 01:03:26.260
We were.
But Katara saved us.

848
01:03:26.362 --> 01:03:28.261
<i>The spiritual power
of these waters</i>

849
01:03:28.397 --> 01:03:30.663
<i>strengthened my healing abilities.</i>

850
01:03:33.376 --> 01:03:34.876
You're incredible. Katara.

851
01:03:36.972 --> 01:03:38.213
Where's Appa?

852
01:03:39.547 --> 01:03:41.212
Tagah must have taken him.

853
01:03:41.843 --> 01:03:43.082
I'm sorry.

854
01:03:43.548 --> 01:03:44.710
No.

855
01:03:45.818 --> 01:03:47.922
I can't believe I trusted him.

856
01:03:49.856 --> 01:03:51.684
We'll get through this.

857
01:03:54.026 --> 01:03:55.830
So. let me get this straight.

858
01:03:55.965 --> 01:03:58.963
He's pulling Sonam's temple
out of the Spirit World

859
01:03:59.065 --> 01:04:01.533
to gain unlimited power.
and let me guess.

860
01:04:01.668 --> 01:04:03.234
you want us to stop him?

861
01:04:04.135 --> 01:04:06.497
Sure. only problem
is your air bro

862
01:04:06.633 --> 01:04:09.171
crushed our ship
and stole your bison.

863
01:04:09.307 --> 01:04:12.606
Also. there's a massive
typhoon surrounding us!

864
01:04:15.445 --> 01:04:18.981
I don't say this very often.
but Sokka's right.

865
01:04:19.116 --> 01:04:21.248
Thank you.
Yep. we're stuck.

866
01:04:21.383 --> 01:04:22.783
And there aren't
enough Lion Turtles

867
01:04:22.891 --> 01:04:24.655
for all of us
to have our own island.

868
01:04:24.790 --> 01:04:26.327
so I'm calling this one.

869
01:04:26.429 --> 01:04:27.561
I'm naming him Snappy.

870
01:04:27.697 --> 01:04:30.021
Aw. Snappy is the best one.

871
01:04:30.157 --> 01:04:31.223
I know.

872
01:04:31.358 --> 01:04:33.233
We may not know where Tagah is.

873
01:04:33.736 --> 01:04:35.270
but we know
what he's looking for

874
01:04:35.438 --> 01:04:36.733
is in the Spirit World.

875
01:04:37.303 --> 01:04:38.730
<i>And lucky for us.</i>

876
01:04:38.899 --> 01:04:41.175
<i>we're stuck in the most
spiritually charged place</i>

877
01:04:41.278 --> 01:04:42.278
<i>on the planet.</i>

878
01:04:42.837 --> 01:04:45.611
<i>So I may be able to open
a portal to get us there.</i>

879
01:04:45.780 --> 01:04:48.774
<i>if I can summon an old friend.</i>

880
01:04:57.160 --> 01:04:58.289
Wow.

881
01:04:59.154 --> 01:05:01.427
The ocean spirit.

882
01:05:08.796 --> 01:05:11.439
This portal smells an awful lot
like the fish market.

883
01:05:11.607 --> 01:05:13.408
I'm gonna go check on Snappy.

884
01:05:13.543 --> 01:05:15.208
Face your death with honor.

885
01:05:15.344 --> 01:05:16.542
I'm sorry.

886
01:05:16.644 --> 01:05:17.940
I know I got us into this.

887
01:05:18.075 --> 01:05:20.411
but I promise you I'll fix it.

888
01:05:20.846 --> 01:05:22.346
We'll fix it...

889
01:05:22.779 --> 01:05:24.150
together.

890
01:05:27.119 --> 01:05:29.453
We're gonna die!
We're gonna die!

891
01:05:29.588 --> 01:05:31.993
Woah!

892
01:05:40.065 --> 01:05:41.999
What?
Where's my power pony?

893
01:05:42.134 --> 01:05:44.834
Uh. were my hands
always this small?

894
01:05:45.002 --> 01:05:46.407
It's Baby Toph!

895
01:05:46.542 --> 01:05:49.233
Baby Toph!

896
01:05:49.369 --> 01:05:51.378
What the hog monkey?

897
01:05:51.480 --> 01:05:52.641
Old people!

898
01:05:52.777 --> 01:05:53.777
Gran Gran?

899
01:05:53.948 --> 01:05:55.616
It's your sister. you meathead!

900
01:05:55.752 --> 01:05:58.076
Give me Toph.
There. there. Toph.

901
01:05:58.212 --> 01:05:59.818
Oh. no. Zuko!

902
01:05:59.954 --> 01:06:01.580
What happened
to your beautiful face?

903
01:06:01.715 --> 01:06:04.557
You look like a dried sea squid.

904
01:06:04.659 --> 01:06:05.989
No. Zuko!
Tired.

905
01:06:06.125 --> 01:06:08.296
Ow. ow. ow!
What's going on here?

906
01:06:08.865 --> 01:06:11.230
The Spirit World
is out of balance.

907
01:06:11.896 --> 01:06:13.529
And so are we.

908
01:06:15.538 --> 01:06:17.071
That's gotta be Tagah.

909
01:06:38.890 --> 01:06:40.157
Oh. no!

910
01:06:40.359 --> 01:06:42.661
He's pulling Sonam's temple
into our world!

911
01:06:42.797 --> 01:06:44.298
We're running out of time!

912
01:06:44.700 --> 01:06:47.431
Chunder!

913
01:06:51.168 --> 01:06:52.932
Pretty good landing.

914
01:06:54.267 --> 01:06:55.738
Whoa! Humans!

915
01:06:55.873 --> 01:06:57.172
I love humans!

916
01:06:57.308 --> 01:06:58.743
Two brothers.
their little sister.

917
01:06:58.878 --> 01:07:00.077
and an elderly couple.

918
01:07:00.246 --> 01:07:01.715
A couple?
Not a couple!

919
01:07:01.851 --> 01:07:04.078
Whoa! Looks like
I touched a nerve.

920
01:07:04.213 --> 01:07:06.111
Oh. look at this one.

921
01:07:06.213 --> 01:07:07.388
Hello. Ow!

922
01:07:07.557 --> 01:07:09.347
Toph. no! Bad Toph.

923
01:07:09.482 --> 01:07:11.192
We don't bite strangers.

924
01:07:12.222 --> 01:07:13.784
Great Spirit. excuse me.

925
01:07:13.886 --> 01:07:15.857
Did you just come from
that temple in the sky?

926
01:07:15.993 --> 01:07:17.429
I certainly did.

927
01:07:18.165 --> 01:07:20.627
It was my favorite hidey-hole
until that dark.

928
01:07:20.729 --> 01:07:23.294
yucky energy started
corrupting this whole place.

929
01:07:23.897 --> 01:07:26.970
Please. we need your help
getting up there.

930
01:07:27.072 --> 01:07:28.903
It's my duty to stop this.

931
01:07:29.338 --> 01:07:31.244
I'm the Avatar.

932
01:07:31.811 --> 01:07:34.975
Ooh. the Avatar.

933
01:07:35.377 --> 01:07:36.641
Let me have a squiz at you.

934
01:07:36.743 --> 01:07:39.481
Okay. Now with this eye.
And this eye.

935
01:07:39.583 --> 01:07:41.388
Mm-hmm. And this eye.
Don't forget this eye.

936
01:07:41.524 --> 01:07:44.358
Hey. hey. can we hurry up?
Every eye needs to have a squiz!

937
01:07:44.460 --> 01:07:45.622
Sniff check!

938
01:07:47.623 --> 01:07:49.991
Ooh. that's Avatar material
right there.

939
01:07:50.093 --> 01:07:52.467
Yes. it is. Oh!

940
01:07:52.602 --> 01:07:53.660
Yes. yes. yes. yes. yes.

941
01:07:53.762 --> 01:07:56.164
It appears the universe
has brought us together

942
01:07:56.266 --> 01:07:58.766
for a very important mission...

943
01:07:58.902 --> 01:08:00.274
Ah?

944
01:08:00.410 --> 01:08:01.703
To flee!

945
01:08:02.237 --> 01:08:03.740
Run for your lives!

946
01:08:03.876 --> 01:08:05.238
Wait. come back!

947
01:08:05.374 --> 01:08:06.907
You're going the wrong way!

948
01:08:07.042 --> 01:08:08.110
Stop!

949
01:08:08.779 --> 01:08:10.526
Please. Great Spirit. both
of our worlds are in danger!

950
01:08:10.550 --> 01:08:14.255
No. no. no. no. no. no.
I am not going back up there.

951
01:08:19.362 --> 01:08:22.790
Hmm. Well. when you put it like
that. it does make more sense.

952
01:08:23.693 --> 01:08:26.194
Upon reflection.
I've decided I shall help you

953
01:08:26.296 --> 01:08:27.592
and your human-y friends.

954
01:08:27.728 --> 01:08:30.098
What did he say?
Nice work. Momo.

955
01:08:30.233 --> 01:08:32.338
All right. in you go.

956
01:08:35.176 --> 01:08:36.696
By the way.
no eating anything you find

957
01:08:36.804 --> 01:08:38.708
in my teeth. as I'm
saving that for later.

958
01:08:39.210 --> 01:08:41.146
Ready. set. get steady and ret.

959
01:08:41.281 --> 01:08:44.318
One and a two
and a you know what to do.

960
01:08:44.486 --> 01:08:45.848
Blast off!

961
01:08:50.754 --> 01:08:53.427
I know we haven't known
each other very long. but...

962
01:08:53.529 --> 01:08:54.893
I love you!

963
01:08:54.995 --> 01:08:56.593
You don't have to say it back.

964
01:09:05.335 --> 01:09:06.764
Hey! You got your hair back!

965
01:09:06.899 --> 01:09:09.870
Why are my eyes teary?
Was I crying?

966
01:09:10.678 --> 01:09:12.437
No way! Look!

967
01:09:12.539 --> 01:09:13.977
What?
What is it?

968
01:09:14.113 --> 01:09:15.876
It's Republic City.

969
01:09:19.154 --> 01:09:21.949
We can't let him destroy
everything we built!

970
01:09:22.085 --> 01:09:23.587
We won't.

971
01:09:38.871 --> 01:09:40.098
Boomerang!

972
01:09:57.485 --> 01:09:58.783
Give me the staff. Tagah!

973
01:09:58.885 --> 01:10:01.391
I see I underestimated you.
Avatar.

974
01:10:01.559 --> 01:10:04.488
Your friends are stronger
than I thought.

975
01:10:04.624 --> 01:10:06.267
But you're too late.

976
01:10:14.500 --> 01:10:15.642
The Denied.

977
01:10:16.078 --> 01:10:18.803
You see?
I did what you wanted. Aang.

978
01:10:18.905 --> 01:10:21.481
I returned airbending
to the world.

979
01:10:23.081 --> 01:10:24.247
What's the plan?

980
01:10:24.717 --> 01:10:27.516
We'll deal with the Denied.
You have to get the staff.

981
01:10:27.785 --> 01:10:30.824
I will rebuild Jharana
on the ruins of our enemies.

982
01:10:30.926 --> 01:10:32.727
just as they did on ours.

983
01:10:32.862 --> 01:10:35.593
A new Air Empire will rise.

984
01:10:36.093 --> 01:10:37.597
Kill them all.

985
01:10:55.844 --> 01:10:58.044
We have to get
these people out of here.

986
01:11:14.362 --> 01:11:15.930
Oh. yeah!

987
01:11:22.975 --> 01:11:24.237
Tagah!

988
01:11:24.373 --> 01:11:25.742
Give it to me!

989
01:11:27.475 --> 01:11:28.743
This isn't the way!

990
01:11:28.879 --> 01:11:31.876
We can use the staff
to bring back balance. peace!

991
01:11:31.978 --> 01:11:34.052
You care so much
about your ideals

992
01:11:34.154 --> 01:11:35.985
that you let your people die!

993
01:11:36.655 --> 01:11:39.360
I will do anything
to make sure they survive!

994
01:11:57.804 --> 01:11:59.745
My cabbages!
Not my cabbages!

995
01:12:05.415 --> 01:12:08.049
My cabbages!

996
01:12:08.218 --> 01:12:11.920
My cabbages!

997
01:12:24.201 --> 01:12:25.370
Don't do this.

998
01:12:25.639 --> 01:12:28.269
You have the power now.
You can decide how to use it.

999
01:12:28.371 --> 01:12:29.372
I'm not like you.

1000
01:12:29.508 --> 01:12:30.877
The world hasn't
been good to me.

1001
01:12:31.046 --> 01:12:32.745
The world is what we make it.

1002
01:12:33.080 --> 01:12:34.613
Get away from her!

1003
01:13:06.782 --> 01:13:08.174
Tagah. stop!

1004
01:13:13.179 --> 01:13:15.222
You betrayed me!
You betrayed our culture!

1005
01:13:15.357 --> 01:13:17.887
I gave you every chance
to see the truth!

1006
01:13:23.826 --> 01:13:26.192
Shouldn't you be
in the Fire Nation?

1007
01:13:28.062 --> 01:13:30.570
I'm fighting for the peace
of all nations!

1008
01:13:33.870 --> 01:13:36.009
Big talk from someone
who sits on a throne

1009
01:13:36.111 --> 01:13:37.841
built on a century of war!

1010
01:14:00.800 --> 01:14:04.395
I'm still the greatest
Earthbender in the world!

1011
01:14:28.163 --> 01:14:30.993
Oh. no.
I'm out of water.

1012
01:14:32.495 --> 01:14:34.562
We got ya!

1013
01:14:34.964 --> 01:14:37.538
And there's no Avatar
here to save you.

1014
01:14:39.141 --> 01:14:41.432
Sokka-Cycle!
Huh?

1015
01:14:45.006 --> 01:14:46.808
Let's see if
your fancy new bending

1016
01:14:46.943 --> 01:14:49.616
can beat some good old
nonbending know-how.

1017
01:14:56.717 --> 01:14:58.449
Bombs away!

1018
01:15:04.660 --> 01:15:06.600
You just got denied!

1019
01:15:07.803 --> 01:15:09.033
Whoa!

1020
01:15:15.807 --> 01:15:18.403
Let's go!
Good luck saving your city.

1021
01:15:19.344 --> 01:15:20.405
Huh?

1022
01:15:26.180 --> 01:15:28.952
We have to save
as many people as we can.

1023
01:15:47.274 --> 01:15:48.669
I know your pain.

1024
01:15:48.804 --> 01:15:50.743
I know what you've been through.

1025
01:15:51.541 --> 01:15:52.837
You don't know.

1026
01:15:53.573 --> 01:15:57.677
I watched as all of my brothers
and sisters were slaughtered.

1027
01:15:58.313 --> 01:16:02.119
When the Fire Nation
burned the Air Nomads to ash.

1028
01:16:02.288 --> 01:16:03.415
where were you?

1029
01:16:04.420 --> 01:16:05.585
You ran!

1030
01:16:26.376 --> 01:16:27.648
Tagah!

1031
01:16:37.750 --> 01:16:38.750
No!

1032
01:17:01.212 --> 01:17:06.483
The full power of the Spirit
World flows through me!

1033
01:17:16.157 --> 01:17:18.732
This is what strength
looks like!

1034
01:18:12.180 --> 01:18:14.046
You should've run away
like you did

1035
01:18:14.215 --> 01:18:17.417
all those years ago.
little Avatar.

1036
01:18:18.091 --> 01:18:19.254
I...

1037
01:18:20.325 --> 01:18:21.695
won't run.

1038
01:18:21.931 --> 01:18:26.492
Then at least you'll die knowing
you're not the last Airbender!

1039
01:19:03.303 --> 01:19:04.662
Aang!

1040
01:19:12.509 --> 01:19:13.509
No!

1041
01:19:44.376 --> 01:19:45.505
No.

1042
01:20:20.548 --> 01:20:22.807
We could've been brothers!

1043
01:20:23.276 --> 01:20:25.143
We could've done this together!

1044
01:20:25.278 --> 01:20:27.778
It didn't have to end like this!

1045
01:20:33.056 --> 01:20:34.384
It's Aang!
He's got the staff!

1046
01:20:34.520 --> 01:20:36.923
Yeah!
Kick his butt. Mega Aang!

1047
01:20:37.058 --> 01:20:38.563
No! Something's wrong!

1048
01:20:38.698 --> 01:20:40.791
The power is corrupting him!

1049
01:20:58.579 --> 01:21:00.981
I dreamt of bringing
the Air Nomads back

1050
01:21:01.083 --> 01:21:02.753
to the world as peacekeepers.

1051
01:21:02.889 --> 01:21:04.687
They could have been
a beacon of light

1052
01:21:04.822 --> 01:21:06.093
for the world to follow.

1053
01:21:06.262 --> 01:21:07.627
But you ruined it!

1054
01:21:07.796 --> 01:21:10.155
You twisted my dream
into a nightmare!

1055
01:21:10.691 --> 01:21:14.524
Finally. you have the power
the Air Nomads need.

1056
01:21:14.660 --> 01:21:17.103
Maybe there is hope
for you after all.

1057
01:21:27.581 --> 01:21:30.445
Do it!
Use the staff!

1058
01:21:30.580 --> 01:21:33.547
Show me you have the strength
to bring our people back!

1059
01:21:34.552 --> 01:21:35.649
Do it!

1060
01:22:12.460 --> 01:22:13.818
<i>Aang.</i>

1061
01:22:16.161 --> 01:22:19.424
<i>You will do so many great things
as the Avatar.</i>

1062
01:22:19.960 --> 01:22:23.894
<i>but you must be prepared to
do what frightens you the most.</i>

1063
01:22:25.436 --> 01:22:30.406
<i>Your people. your home.
we are always with you.</i>

1064
01:22:46.888 --> 01:22:48.028
No.

1065
01:22:54.126 --> 01:22:55.530
No!

1066
01:23:18.757 --> 01:23:21.127
No! My power!

1067
01:23:27.269 --> 01:23:28.563
No.

1068
01:23:29.062 --> 01:23:30.268
No!

1069
01:23:39.744 --> 01:23:40.872
You fool!

1070
01:23:41.008 --> 01:23:42.445
Why?

1071
01:23:42.947 --> 01:23:44.812
Why did you break it?

1072
01:23:45.247 --> 01:23:48.854
We could have fixed everything.

1073
01:23:48.989 --> 01:23:51.718
We can't erase
the pain of the past.

1074
01:23:52.891 --> 01:23:54.123
We couldn't save them.

1075
01:23:54.292 --> 01:23:57.964
But it's our duty
to protect our people.

1076
01:23:58.133 --> 01:24:01.366
Not at the cost of betraying
everything they stood for.

1077
01:24:01.468 --> 01:24:02.762
No.

1078
01:24:03.263 --> 01:24:04.962
It's time to let go.

1079
01:24:05.938 --> 01:24:07.866
You have to forgive yourself.

1080
01:24:10.437 --> 01:24:12.706
I have to forgive myself too.

1081
01:24:21.549 --> 01:24:24.586
Air nomads are formed
from the mist.

1082
01:24:28.458 --> 01:24:32.495
We walk the world
for a moment in time.

1083
01:24:34.793 --> 01:24:39.139
Then we return
to the eternal wind.

1084
01:24:55.183 --> 01:24:56.750
Aang!

1085
01:25:00.286 --> 01:25:02.020
Hey. Katara.

1086
01:25:02.156 --> 01:25:03.328
Hey. Aang.

1087
01:25:05.830 --> 01:25:06.832
Seriously?

1088
01:25:06.968 --> 01:25:09.133
You do realize
you're falling. right?

1089
01:25:09.268 --> 01:25:11.564
Hey. if you ever get tired
of relying on Appa.

1090
01:25:11.666 --> 01:25:13.868
I could hook you up
with one of these babies.

1091
01:25:18.838 --> 01:25:21.181
I'll give you
the best friend discount!

1092
01:25:31.957 --> 01:25:33.292
These are pretty good!

1093
01:25:35.230 --> 01:25:37.694
<i>I don't know
if airbending will ever return.</i>

1094
01:25:38.264 --> 01:25:40.064
<i>but I know now
that the true power</i>

1095
01:25:40.200 --> 01:25:43.236
of the Air Nomads
was never their bending.

1096
01:25:43.803 --> 01:25:45.162
It was their values.

1097
01:25:45.865 --> 01:25:49.305
And that's a power
I can pass on to others.

1098
01:25:49.407 --> 01:25:52.776
Avatar Aang. you are
the true embodiment

1099
01:25:52.878 --> 01:25:54.414
of the Air Nomads.

1100
01:25:55.250 --> 01:25:58.484
Thank you for giving up
the power that I could not.

1101
01:25:59.154 --> 01:26:02.387
You give me hope for the future
of our culture.

1102
01:26:16.331 --> 01:26:18.063
It's amazing. isn't it?

1103
01:26:18.699 --> 01:26:21.736
The first new air temple
in centuries.

1104
01:26:22.736 --> 01:26:25.443
Republic City
is finally complete.

1105
01:26:29.284 --> 01:26:32.880
A city for all nations.
just like you promised.

1106
01:26:33.783 --> 01:26:36.289
I never could have done this
without you. Katara.

1107
01:26:37.758 --> 01:26:38.956
Hey. everybody.

1108
01:26:39.091 --> 01:26:40.760
Sorry I kept you all waiting.

1109
01:26:40.928 --> 01:26:42.757
Are you ready for our big trip?

1110
01:26:43.860 --> 01:26:47.359
As my new acolytes. you'll be
helping me preserve our culture

1111
01:26:47.461 --> 01:26:48.961
for future generations.

1112
01:26:49.730 --> 01:26:52.399
So. who wants
to search for artifacts

1113
01:26:52.535 --> 01:26:54.133
at an ancient abandoned temple?

1114
01:26:54.302 --> 01:26:55.369
Yay.

1115
01:26:55.638 --> 01:26:56.945
I'm only going
to make sure you don't try

1116
01:26:56.969 --> 01:26:59.372
to release another
beefy old Airbender.

1117
01:26:59.508 --> 01:27:01.809
Yeah. I'm done with bad boys.

1118
01:27:13.756 --> 01:27:15.853
Avatar Sonam told me
about this place.

1119
01:27:15.955 --> 01:27:18.555
So it's very possible
that no one's been here

1120
01:27:18.657 --> 01:27:20.333
in hundreds of years.

1121
01:27:21.564 --> 01:27:24.364
Oh! Is this
an Airbender relic?

1122
01:27:24.466 --> 01:27:26.101
I think that's just a rock.

1123
01:27:26.237 --> 01:27:27.967
But I love the enthusiasm.

1124
01:27:28.776 --> 01:27:30.468
Aw!

1125
01:27:34.014 --> 01:27:35.180
Keep your eyes open.

1126
01:27:35.315 --> 01:27:37.350
You never know what
we might discover here.

1127
01:27:39.015 --> 01:27:40.320
Woah!

1128
01:27:46.928 --> 01:27:48.493
I thought they were extinct.

1129
01:27:55.837 --> 01:27:57.370
I can't believe it.

1130
01:27:58.037 --> 01:27:59.966
The original Airbenders.

1131
01:28:07.111 --> 01:28:09.339
Aw. can I have one?

1132
01:28:10.719 --> 01:28:12.748
Appa. yip yip!
